The task description tells you which HLR needs a test case and provides the SUITE parent ID. Create ONE CASE_HLR for that specific HLR.

IMPORTANT: Every HLR gets its OWN dedicated CASE_HLR. Do NOT add this HLR to an existing CASE node's trace_to. Always create a new CASE_HLR.

graph_add_node:
   - node_type = CASE_HLR
   - parent_id = SUITE node ID (from task description)
   - content = test case specification: objective, preconditions, test steps, expected result, pass criteria
   - title = 3–5 words (e.g. 'Login Success Test')
   - trace_to = [the single HLR node ID this case verifies]

